{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":60,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܥܠܔ ܫܘܼܫܲܢ ܥܹܕܘܿܬ. ܡܸܟ݂ܬܵܡ ܕܕܘܝܕ ܠܡܠܘܦܐ، ܐܝܡܢ ܕܦܠܝܫ ܠܗ ܥܡ ܐܪܡ ܢܗܪ̈ܝܢ ܘܥܡ ܐܪܡ ܨܘܒ݂ܐ، ܘܕܝܪܗ ܝܘܐܒ݂ ܘܡܚܐ ܠܗ ܬܪܥܣܪ ܐܠܦ̈ܐ ܐܕܘܡܝ̈ܐ ܒܪܘܘܠܐ ܕܡܠܚܐ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܩܵܡ ܡܲܚܦܸܠܸܬ ܠܲܢ ܘܩܵܡ ܬܵܪܥܹܬ ܠܲܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܪܝܼܒ ܠܘܼܟ݂؛ ܡܲܕܸܪܸܬ ܠܲܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܘܼܪܘܸܕܵܐ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܐܲܪܥܵܐ، ܟ̰ܠܝܼܦܵܐ ܠܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܲܣܸܡ ܬܒ݂ܵܪܬܘܼܗ̇ ܣܵܒܵܒ ܫܥܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܚܙܹܐ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܠܥܲܡܘܼܟ݂ ܩܸܫܝܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܵܡ ܡܲܫܬܹܝܬ ܠܲܢ ܚܲܡܪܵܐ ܦܲܢܦܸܠܵܢܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܘܼܗܒܹܠܔ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܐܵܬܵ‌ܐ ܠܙܕܝܼܥܘܼ̈ܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܸܥܪܵܩܵܐ ܟܸܣ ܠܘܼܗ̇ ܡܩܲܕܡ ܩܸܫܬܵ‌ܐ، ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܵܐ ܕܚܵܠܨܝܼ ܡܘܼܚܸܒܘܼ̈ܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܲܪܸܩ ܒܝܲܡܝܼܢܘܼܟ݂ ܘܓ̰ܲܘܸܒ ܠܲܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܗܘܼܡܙܸܡ ܠܹܗ ܒܩܘܼܕܫܹܗ: ”ܒܸܬ ܦܵܨܚܹܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܦܲܠܥܸܢ ܠܫܟܹܝܡ ܘܪܵܘܘܿܠܵܐ ܕܣܵܟܘܼܬ ܒܸܬ ܟܵܝܠܹܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܕܝܼܝܼ ܝܠܹܗ ܓܸܠܥܵܕ، ܘܕܝܼܝܼ ܝܠܹܗ ܡܢܲܫܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܦܪܹܝܡ ܣܲܢܘܲܪܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܪܹܝܫܝܼ، ܝܼܗܘܼܕܵܐ ܚܘܼܛܪܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܡܘܼܐܵܒ݂ ܡܵܪܸܓܠܵܐ ܕܚܲܠܲܠܬ‌ܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܐܲܕܘܿܡ ܒܸܬ ܪܲܦܹܝܢ ܨܵܘܸܠܬ‌ܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܦܠܸܫܬ ܒܸܬ ܡܲܩܘܸܚܸܢ.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܢܝܼ ܒܸܬ ܠܲܒܸܠܔ ܠܝܼ ܠܡܕܝܼܢ݇ܬܵ‌ܐ ܡܘܼܩܘܝܼܬܵ‌ܐ؟","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܢܝܼ ܒܸܬ ܡܗܲܕܹܐ ܠܝܼ ܗܲܠܔ ܐܲܕܘܿܡ؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܵܐ، ܠܹܐ ܝܘܸܬ ܐܲܢ݇ܬ ܡܘܼܚܦܸܠܵܐ ܐܸܠܲܢ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ؟","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܹܐ ܦܵܠܛܹܬ ܥܲܡ ܚܲܝܠܵܘܵܬܲܢ̈، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܒ݂ܠܔ ܠܲܢ ܗܲܝܲܪܬܵ‌ܐ ܩܲܕܡ ܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܣܪܝܼܩܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇ ܦܲܪܲܩܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܒܲܪܢܵܫܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܥܵܒ݂ܕܲܚ ܓܲܒܵܪܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܗ̇ܘ ܒܸܬ ܕܲܫܕܸܫ ܠܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢܲܢ̈.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/60.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/61.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/59.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}